{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "我看得出你的心地很正直。\r\n来，让我替你占卜\r\n城镇的位置吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "哎呀呀，来了位大人物。\r\n就算你逃走，也不会有人责怪吧，\r\n可你却为了我们亲自冒险。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "为了你这样的人，\r\n我可不能袖手旁观。\r\n来，让我替你占卜前路。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "哎呀，是位旅人？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "好，那就这样吧。\r\n让我占卜一下\r\n下一座城镇的位置。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_18_map_old_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "总之，努力试试就好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/0": "好嘞！以后再来啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1": "……我是个铁匠。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/337": "完全修理装备中的武器[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/422": "完全修理装备中的武器[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/592": "完全修理装备中的防具[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/676": "完全修理装备中的防具[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/846": "完全修理装备中的盾牌[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/931": "完全修理装备中的盾牌[\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]拉比斯]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/1024": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/2": "看来眼下\r\n没有我能为你做的事。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/3": "没装备在身上的东西我可修不了。\r\n如果有想修理的装备，\r\n先把它装备上再来找我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/4": "我是开铁匠铺的。\r\n可以替你修理1件装备。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/5": "这样啊。要是有需要修理的装备，\r\n再来找我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/6": "真遗憾！\r\n看来你的钱不够。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/7": "明白了！\r\n要修理\\c[52]<weapon>\\c[0]，对吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/8": "这把武器挺不错……\r\n稍等一会儿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/9": "交给我吧！\r\n要修理\\c[52]<armor>\\c[0]，对吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/10": "……嗯，这件防具不赖。\r\n在旁边稍等一会儿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/11": "好！\r\n要修理\\c[52]<shield>\\c[0]，对吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/12": "……这块盾牌也不赖。\r\n在旁边稍等一会儿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/13": "那好，开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/14": "装备耐久度已完全恢复！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_talk.txt/15": "完成了！\r\n给，好好爱惜着用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_192_blacksmith_ev_wanted.txt/0": "你妨碍我干活了！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/144": "现在还不饿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/0": "还想再吃？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是暗黑料理人……\r\n只要给我一大笔钱，\r\n我就填饱你那愚蠢的肚子。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/2": "你的钱不够，\r\n我没什么能替你做的。\r\n想吃白食，就去翻垃圾吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/3": "好吧……\r\n好好尝尝超元气套餐的滋味！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/5": "力量涌遍全身！\r\n这料理真是惊人！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/6": "嚼嚼嚼！！\r\n美味得简直不像是\r\n这个世界的东西！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/7": "哼……既然这么喜欢，\r\n下次见面之前就多攒些钱吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_193_dark_cook_ev_talk.txt/8": "是吗？那就随你吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_194_dark_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "我是暗黑旅行商人。\r\n只卖高级货。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_194_dark_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "只要你有钱，\r\n我就能提供一些\r\n品质绝对可靠的好东西。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_194_dark_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "再来吧。\r\n别忘了带足拉比斯。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_damage.txt/0": "嘶……咴……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_damage.txt/1": "嘶咴——！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_damage.txt/2": "嘶咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_darkness.txt/0": "嘶咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_find.txt/0": "嘶……咴咴——！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/153": "\\c[52]存取物品\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/294": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/405": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2][浪费]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/563": "给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/671": "\\c[4]给予疗伤草_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/811": "给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/920": "\\c[4]给予疗伤膏_\\c[52]剩余$tmp2_remaining\\c[2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/1019": "你还好吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/0": "看来几乎没受伤，\r\n不需要治疗。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/1": "你没有任何物品！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/2": "嘶咴——！\r\n（精神得很！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/3": "嘶咴——。\r\n（还很精神。）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/4": "嘶咴……\r\n（有点难受……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/5": "嘶咴……咳……\r\n（已经快要死了……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/6": "嘎吱嘎吱……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/7": "HP恢复了50%。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/8": "嘶咴——！（感觉好多了！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/9": "咕咚咕咚……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/10": "HP已完全恢复。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_195_horse_ev_talk.txt/11": "好耶！\r\n嘶咴——！（精神极了！）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/0": "等——！\r\n你就这样出来，也、也太夸张了吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "你需要……武器吗？\r\n（不过我觉得你该先买件衣服）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "这不是女王陛下吗！\r\n哎呀，能见到您真是荣幸！\r\n来来，请看看本店的武器！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "嗨，旅人。\r\n需要武器吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/4": "看到穿红衣服的商人，\r\n那就是武器商！\r\n记住这个绝不吃亏！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_talk.txt/5": "穿红衣服的商人就是武器商！\r\n记住这个不会有坏处！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_19_wepon_shop_ev_wanted.txt/0": "你是罪人啊，\r\n可这世道也没有办法。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/0": "若再犯罪，就再来找我吧。\r\n只要献上你的“心意”……\r\n神明便永远站在你这边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/1": "我只能替你\r\n洗清一次罪孽。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/2": "若你是罪人，\r\n就在这里“诚心诚意”地\r\n忏悔吧。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/512": "\\c[52]10拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-1]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/567": "\\c[52]2000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-4/猎杀动物罪-1]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/635": "\\c[52]5000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-10/猎杀动物罪-2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/704": "\\c[52]10000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-22/猎杀动物罪-5]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/784": "\\c[52]10拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-1]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/844": "\\c[52]2000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-4/猎杀动物罪-1]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/917": "\\c[52]5000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-10/猎杀动物罪-2]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/991": "\\c[52]10000拉比斯\\c[0]支付[通缉度-22/猎杀动物罪-5]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/1074": "我没什么困扰。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/3": "让我看看你有多热切地\r\n希望赎罪吧！\r\n[通缉度 \\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]/猎杀动物罪 \\c[52]$tmp2\\c[0]]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/4": "原来如此……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/5": "等等，<PLAYER>！\r\n你既没有“通缉度”，\r\n也没有“猎杀动物罪”！不用付钱给他！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/6": "啧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/7": "这样啊。\r\n若你需要赎罪，\r\n再来找我吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/8": "你的心意\r\n没有传达给神明。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/9": "啧……穷鬼……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/10": "失礼了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/11": "你的心意……我确实感受到了。\r\n神明也一定收到了这份心念。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/12": "哦，神明啊……\r\n请洗净此人的罪孽吧——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/13": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\r\n通缉度变为\\c[3]$tmp3\\c[0]！\r\n猎杀动物罪变为\\c[3]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的\r\n通缉度变为\\c[3]$tmp3\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/15": "看来神明回应了\r\n你强烈的“心意”。\r\n你的罪孽已经得到宽恕……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_202_priest_ev_talk.txt/16": "好了，去吧，神之子。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_find.txt/0": "哎呀哎呀。\r\n嘻嘻嘻！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/0": "嘻嘻！\r\n下次再来吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/1": "想不想看看\r\n老身的炼金术？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/249": "拜托了！_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/301": "拜托了！_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/350": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/2": "哎呀哎呀，上次真是抱歉……\r\n这次只要你付钱，\r\n我就替你制作\\c[52]3\\c[0]件物品。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/582": "拜托了！_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/634": "拜托了！_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/3": "只要你付钱，我就替你制作\r\n\\c[52]一件\\c[0]东西……嘻嘻！！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/683": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/4": "你问会做出什么？\r\n那要等做出来才有趣嘛。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/5": "报酬不够啊……\r\n等攒够钱再来吧。\r\n嘻嘻嘻嘻……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/6": "这样啊？那等你兴起时\r\n再来吧。\r\n嘻嘻嘻嘻！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/7": "好，好，报酬确实收到了。\r\n那么，开始喽……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/8": "呼哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/9": "炼金婆婆的手开始发光。\r\n周围的空气正被吸入\r\n她的掌中。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/10": "完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/11": "幻影之刃完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/12": "幻影盾完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/13": "两个甜坚果完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/14": "两颗幻影药丸完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/15": "幻影之刃完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/16": "幻影盾完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/17": "两个甜坚果完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/18": "两颗幻影药丸完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/19": "幻影之刃完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/20": "幻影盾完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/21": "两个甜坚果完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/22": "两颗幻影药丸完成了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/23": "呼……呼……怎么样？\r\n可还满意？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/24": "炼金婆婆的手中……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/25": "什么都没有……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/28": "抱歉啊……\r\n有、有时候也会这样……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_talk.txt/29": "嘻嘻！\r\n下次再来吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_203_alchemist_ev_wanted.txt/0": "嘻嘻嘻嘻！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_find.txt/0": "欢迎光临！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/0": "把这儿当自己家吧。\r\n想要酒的话，我卖给你。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/195": "喝！_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]（EN+75%，微醺）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/264": "吃！_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯\\c[0]（EN+30%，HP+80）",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/329": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/1": "欢迎来到“名酒之城”！\r\n要来点提神饮料吗？饭也有哦！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/2": "这样啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/3": "真可惜，看来你的钱不够！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_204_bartender_ev_talk.txt/4": "来！一口气喝下去！\r\n感受这股活力！！",
